{"text":"<p><span><a>https://youtu.be/I4Arpa0ewpE?si=C-F-iibiR489q9Lb</a></span></p><p><br /></p>### 6. Chaṭṭhanayo ^3-6-0 <p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> #### 6. Sampayogavippayogapadaniddeso ^3-6a-0 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 1. Khandho</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4.009654\">00:04</span> 228. Rūpakkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi sampayuttoti? Natthi. Katihi vippayutto? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-228 </p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"36.649243\">00:36</span> 229. Vedanākkhandho… saññākkhandho… saṅkhārakkhandho tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-229</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"84.978892\">01:24</span> 230. Viññāṇakkhandho tīhi khandhehi sampayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-230 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 2. Āyatanaṃ </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"118.983313\">01:58</span> 231. Cakkhāyatanaṃ…pe… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ…pe… sampayuttanti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttaṃ ? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-231\n<br /> </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"149.104317\">02:29</span> 232. Manāyatanaṃ tīhi khandhehi sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-232 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 3. Dhātu</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"184.236078\">03:04</span>  233. Cakkhudhātu …pe… phoṭṭhabbadhātu…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-233</p><p> \n<br /> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"215.424633\">03:35</span>  234. Cakkhuviññāṇadhātu…pe… manodhātu… manoviññāṇadhātu tīhi khandhehi sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-234 </p><p><br /></p><p>##### 4. <span>Saccādi\n\n</span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"254.550338\">04:14</span><span> 235. Samudayasaccaṃ… maggasaccaṃ tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttaṃ; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-235 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"299.063943\">04:59</span><span> 236. Nirodhasaccaṃ… cakkhundriyaṃ…pe… kāyindriyaṃ… itthindriyaṃ… purisindriyaṃ…pe… sampayuttanti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-236</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"334.030662\">05:34</span><span> 237. Manindriyaṃ tīhi khandhehi sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-237</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"367.68884\">06:07</span><span> 238. Sukhindriyaṃ… dukkhindriyaṃ… somanassindriyaṃ… domanassindriyaṃ tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-238 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"411.641524\">06:51</span><span> 239. Upekkhindriyaṃ tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena chahi dhātūhi sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-239 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"449.845564\">07:29</span><span> 240. Saddhindriyaṃ… vīriyindriyaṃ… satindriyaṃ… samādhindriyaṃ… paññindriyaṃ… anaññātaññassāmītindriyaṃ… aññindriyaṃ… aññātāvindriyaṃ… avijjā… avijjāpaccayā saṅkhārā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttā; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-240 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"509.962236\">08:29</span><span> 241. Saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṃ tīhi khandhehi sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-241 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"543.593931\">09:03</span><span> 242. Saḷāyatanapaccayā phasso tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-242 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"586.169102\">09:46</span><span> 243. Phassapaccayā vedanā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-243 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"626.533759\">10:26</span><span> 244. Vedanāpaccayā taṇhā… taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ… kammabhavo tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-244</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"674.598208\">11:14</span> 245. Rūpabhavo…pe… sampayuttoti? Natthi. Katihi vippayutto? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi vippayutto. ^3-6a-245 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"695.072497\">11:35</span> 246. Arūpabhavo… nevasaññānāsaññābhavo… catuvokārabhavo…pe… sampayuttoti? Natthi. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-246</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"727.727656\">12:07</span> 247. Asaññābhavo… ekavokārabhavo… paridevo…pe… sampayuttoti? Natthi. Katihi vippayutto? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-247 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"758.704378\">12:38</span> 248. Soko… dukkhaṃ… domanassaṃ tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-248 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"801.18444\">13:21</span> 249. Upāyāso… satipaṭṭhānaṃ… sammappadhānaṃ tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttaṃ; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-249</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"846.682881\">14:06</span> 250. Iddhipādo dvīhi khandhehi sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-250</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"883.494248\">14:43</span> 251. Jhānaṃ dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttaṃ; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-251 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"924.154269\">15:24</span> 252. Appamaññā… pañcindriyāni… pañca balāni… satta bojjhaṅgā… ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-252 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"976.320065\">16:16</span> 253. Phasso … cetanā… manasikāro tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-253</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.99864\">17:00</span> 254. Vedanā… saññā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-254</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1060.247607\">17:40</span> 255. Cittaṃ tīhi khandhehi sampayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttaṃ. Katihi vippayuttaṃ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttaṃ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttaṃ. ^3-6a-255 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1094.290165\">18:14</span> 256. Adhimokkho tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena dvīhi dhātūhi sampayutto; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayutto. Katihi vippayutto? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayutto; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayutto. ^3-6a-256 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 5. Tikaṃ </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1135.931053\">18:55</span> 257. Kusalā dhammā… akusalā dhammā katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā ? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-257</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1172.340393\">19:32</span> 258. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā… dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā ; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-258</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1215.123416\">20:15</span> 259. Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-259</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1254.026384\">20:54</span> 260. Vipākā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-260</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1279.940787\">21:19</span> 261. Vipākadhammadhammā… saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-261</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1312.082516\">21:52</span> 262. Nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammā… anupādinnupādāniyā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti ? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-262 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1338.919301\">22:18</span> 263. Anupādinnaanupādāniyā dhammā… asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-263</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1366.416367\">22:46</span> 264. Savitakkasavicārā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-264 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1400.001505\">23:20</span> 265. Avitakkavicāramattā dhammā… pītisahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-265</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1437.383968\">23:57</span> 266. Avitakkaavicārā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi ekāya dhātuyā vippayuttā. ^3-6a-266</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1458.788988\">24:18</span> 267. Sukhasahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-267</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1494.334061\">24:54</span> 268. Upekkhāsahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-268</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1530.092706\">25:30</span> 269. Dassanena pahātabbā dhammā bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā… dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā… ācayagāmino dhammā… apacayagāmino dhammā… sekkhā dhammā… asekkhā dhammā… mahaggatā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-269</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1584.787455\">26:24</span> 270. Appamāṇā dhammā… paṇītā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-270</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1607.825483\">26:47</span> 271. Parittārammaṇā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-271 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1635.020869\">27:15</span> 272. Mahaggatārammaṇā dhammā… appamāṇārammaṇā dhammā… hīnā dhammā… micchattaniyatā dhammā… sammattaniyatā dhammā… maggārammaṇā dhammā… maggahetukā dhammā… maggādhipatino dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-272 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1683.19158\">28:03</span> 273. Anuppannā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-273 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1704.519711\">28:24</span> 274. Atītārammaṇā dhammā…pe… anāgatārammaṇā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-274</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1735.343417\">28:55</span> 275. Paccuppannārammaṇā dhammā… ajjhattārammaṇā dhammā… bahiddhārammaṇā dhammā… ajjhattabahiddhārammaṇā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-275 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1773.109946\">29:33</span> 276. Sanidassanasappaṭighā dhammā… anidassanasappaṭighā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti ? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-276 </p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 6. Dukaṃ</p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1805.837339\">30:05</span> 277. Hetū dhammā… hetū ceva sahetukā ca dhammā… hetū ceva hetusampayuttā ca dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttā; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-277 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1856.10615\">30:56</span> 278. Sahetukā dhammā… hetusampayuttā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-278 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1887.071243\">31:27</span> 279. Sahetukā ceva na ca hetū dhammā… hetusampayuttā ceva na ca hetū dhammā… na hetusahetukā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-279 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1931.162812\">32:11</span> 280. Appaccayā dhammā… asaṅkhatā dhammā… sanidassanā dhammā… sappaṭighā dhammā… rūpino dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-280 </p><p><br /></p><p> \n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1968.461897\">32:48</span> 281. Lokuttarā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-281</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1988.991\">33:08</span> 282. Āsavā dhammā… āsavā ceva sāsavā ca dhammā… āsavā ceva āsavasampayuttā ca dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttā; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-282</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2039.978025\">33:59</span> 283. Anāsavā dhammā… āsavavippayuttā anāsavā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-283</p><p><br /></p><p> \n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2064.575327\">34:24</span> 284. Āsavasampayuttā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-284 </p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>  </span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2091.89438\">34:51</span><span> 285. Āsavasampayuttā ceva no ca āsavā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-285 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2128.285035\">35:28</span><span> 286. Saṃyojanā dhammā… ganthā dhammā… oghā dhammā… yogā dhammā… nīvaraṇā dhammā… parāmāsā dhammā… parāmāsā ceva parāmaṭṭhā ca dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttā; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-286 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2185.184737\">36:25</span><span> 287. Aparāmaṭṭhā dhammā… parāmāsavippayuttā aparāmaṭṭhā dhammā sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-287 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2211.549264\">36:51</span><span> 288. Parāmāsasampayuttā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-288</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2246.526492\">37:26</span><span> 289. Sārammaṇā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-289 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2272.854487\">37:52</span><span> 290. Anārammaṇā dhammā… cittavippayuttā dhammā… cittavisaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā… upādā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-290</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2308.858065\">38:28</span><span> 291. Cittā dhammā tīhi khandhehi sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-291 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2342.810981\">39:02</span><span> 292. Cetasikā dhammā… cittasampayuttā dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānā dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuno dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattino dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-292</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2397.981291\">39:57</span><span> 293. Anupādinnā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-293 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2418.761852\">40:18</span><span> 294. Upādānā dhammā… kilesā dhammā… kilesā ceva saṃkilesikā ca dhammā… kilesā ceva saṃkiliṭṭhā ca dhammā… kilesā ceva kilesasampayuttā ca dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā sampayuttā; ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-294</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2477.072201\">41:17</span><span> 295. Asaṃkilesikā dhammā… kilesavippayuttā asaṃkilesikā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti ? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-295</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2503.879984\">41:43</span><span> 296. Saṃkiliṭṭhā dhammā… kilesasampayuttā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-296 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2533.484554\">42:13</span><span> 297. Saṃkiliṭṭhā ceva no ca kilesā dhammā… kilesasampayuttā ceva no ca kilesā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-297 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2575.617058\">42:55</span><span> 298. Dassanena pahātabbā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā… dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-298</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2618.308312\">43:38</span><span> 299. Savitakkā dhammā… savicārā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-299 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2654.198545\">44:14</span><span> 300. Avitakkā dhammā… avicārā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi ekāya dhātuyā vippayuttā. ^3-6a-300</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2677.389029\">44:37</span><span> 301. Sappītikā dhammā… pītisahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-301 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2714.744362\">45:14</span><span> 302. Sukhasahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-302 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2750.305202\">45:50</span><span> 303. Upekkhāsahagatā dhammā ekena khandhena sampayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici sampayuttā. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-303</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2787.065003\">46:27</span><span> 304. Na kāmāvacarā dhammā… apariyāpannā dhammā… anuttarā dhammā…pe… sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi chahi dhātūhi vippayuttā. ^3-6a-304 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2813.589936\">46:53</span><span> 305. Rūpāvacarā dhammā… arūpāvacarā dhammā… niyyānikā dhammā… niyatā dhammā… saraṇā dhammā katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi sampayuttāti? Natthi. Katihi vippayuttā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi vippayuttā; ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā kehici vippayuttā. ^3-6a-305\n\nSampayogavippayogapadaniddeso chaṭṭho.</span></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><span></span><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p>","media-time":41.187451202178956}